IMPORT `usca-proclaimed-days`

-- Tests of usca-proclaimed-days.l4 (Gov. Code §§ 6708-6736).  Each expected value is decided from the section cited above the assertion, before the run;
-- the weekdays of 2025-2028 were worked out from 1 January 2026 being a Thursday.  A failing assertion is a finding.

§ `The table has one entry for each of the 26 sections, with the name the section gives the day`

#ASSERT count `the proclamations of Gov. Code §§ 6708-6736` EQUALS 26

