§ `Days fixed by a weekday of a month: §§ 6712, 6713, 6719, 6726`

-- § 6712: the fourth Friday in September.  2026-09-01 is a Tuesday: Fridays 4, 11, 18, 25.  2027-09-01 is a Wednesday: Fridays 3, 10, 17, 24.
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6712" `in the year` 2026 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2026 9 25), (YMD 2026 9 25)
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6712" `in the year` 2027 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2027 9 24), (YMD 2027 9 24)
-- § 6713: the first Sunday in October.  2026-10-01 is a Thursday: Sunday 4.  2027-10-01 is a Friday: Sunday 3.
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6713" `in the year` 2026 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2026 10 4), (YMD 2026 10 4)
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6713" `in the year` 2027 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2027 10 3), (YMD 2027 10 3)
-- § 6719: the third Saturday in June.  2026-06-01 is a Monday: Saturdays 6, 13, 20.
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6719" `in the year` 2026 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2026 6 20), (YMD 2026 6 20)
-- § 6726: the first Friday in May.  2026-05-01 is a Friday; 2027-05-01 is a Saturday, so the first Friday is 7 May.
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6726" `in the year` 2026 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2026 5 1), (YMD 2026 5 1)
#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6726" `in the year` 2027 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2027 5 7), (YMD 2027 5 7)

§ `Whole months: §§ 6718 and 6728`

#ASSERT `the days the Governor is directed to proclaim under` "6718" `in the year` 2026 `given the day of the astronomical Northward equinox:` NOTHING EQUALS `Period of days` OF (YMD 2026 2 1), (YMD 2026 2 28)
